            <ArticleTitle>[Chronic pelvic pain: a psychoclinical approach].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>365-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>To take care of a patient presenting with chronic pelvic pain requires a long-term approach considering all the organic, psychological and sexological aspects of the problem. To relieve the patient, it could be very useful to analyse the doctor-patient relationship. Most probably a multidisciplinary team with all the colleagues caring for the patient is the best place to discuss these items.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
